## `opt_stylize()`: premade themes

Below are the first two premade styles. The first uses `color="blue"`, and the second uses
`color="red"`.

:::::: {.grid}
:::{.g-col-lg-6 .g-col-12}

::: {#f2ca9261 .cell execution_count=2}
``` {.python .cell-code}
gt_ex.opt_stylize(style=1, color="blue")
```

